								<p style="font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 0.35rem !important;">Important Notice for Readers</p>
								<p style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;">
									The models, observations, dietary protocols, and tooth margin audits presented in this volume are shared exclusively for educational, investigative, and informational purposes. They are intended to assist patients in framing informed, constructive discussions with qualified clinicians.
								</p>
							</div>
