								<p class="exec-card-text">
									Practical citizen science tools for root cause discovery: the comprehensive BMS Diagnostic Questionnaire, ruling out red flags, 14-day low-acid elimination, physical barrier shielding (nightguards, tubule sealers), the 6-Day Flare Reset Protocol, non-acid alternatives, and constructive clinical communication scripts for partnering with your physician and&nbsp;dentist.
								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="exec-section-card">
								<h3 class="exec-card-title">Part V: The Future of Burning Mouth</h3>
								<p class="exec-card-text">
									Let's build the future: understanding the diabetic small-fiber neuropathy parallel, dismantling systemic clinical bottlenecks (15-minute chair limits, insurance gaps), tracking long-term remission trajectories, answering critical patient FAQs, and launching open-source citizen science registries to advance clinical care for all&nbsp;sufferers.
								</p>
