							<div class="exec-takeaway-box">
								<div class="exec-takeaway-title">The Core Takeaway</div>
								<p class="exec-takeaway-text">
									Nerve pathways transmit the pain, but ambient oral acidity, bacterial fermentation, and microscopic physical breaches frequently act as the unaddressed peripheral triggers. Investigating acid reduction, tubule desensitization, and dental margin integrity provides a safe, constructive path forward without dismissing comprehensive clinical&nbsp;care.
