								<strong>Figure 5: Trigeminal Convergence &amp; Signal Bleed.</strong> How a localized acid leak under a mandibular molar (V<sub>3</sub>) causes central wind-up in the Subnucleus Caudalis, projecting referred burning across the palate (V<sub>2</sub>) and lingual&nbsp;mucosa.
							</figcaption>
