						<p style="font-size: 0.94rem; line-height: 1.68; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; text-wrap: pretty;">
							Use this comprehensive clinical diagnostic questionnaire to map your symptom profile, identify triggers, and establish an actionable record. You can select your answers directly on this page; your entries are preserved locally and can be printed or shared with your dental and medical&nbsp;providers.
