							</span>
							<div class="book-callout-text">
								<p><strong>The Final Lesson of Cheating:</strong> Do not beat yourself up over setbacks. Use each cheat as objective scientific confirmation that acid is your sole antagonist. When you radically accept this reality, you step out of bargaining and into permanent&nbsp;peace.</p>
							</div>
