						<h3>Modern Physical Solutions: Root Recessions vs. Leaky Fillings</h3>
						<p>When oral burning flares from peripheral acid ingress through exposed dentinal tubules, abfraction notches, or degrading restoration borders, targeted physical barriers provide essential defense. Because biological root collars and restoration boundaries face fundamentally different mechanical stresses, modern dental solutions are organized into two distinct clinical&nbsp;categories.</p>

