						<h3>Section 1: Modern Solutions for Root Recessions</h3>
						<p>Exposed tooth roots present 20,000 to 45,000 open tubules per square millimeter directly exposed to saliva. Choosing the right physical barrier depends on whether you require an instant diagnostic test, biological remineralization, or definitive structural&nbsp;coverage:</p>

