						<h3>What a "No-Burp" Dentist Looks Like for BMS</h3>
						<p>What specific qualifications define a forward-thinking dental ally for Burning Mouth Syndrome? A BMS champion clinician understands three foundational realities:</p>
						<ol>
							<li><strong>They Understand Microscopic Fluid Leaks:</strong> They know that standard 2D bitewing X-rays and explorer probes cannot detect sub-micron cement washout or patent dentinal tubules (which require scanning electron microscopy). They do not dismiss you when X-rays appear "pristine."</li>
