						<p>Just as R-CPD patients assembled a crowdsourced global map of open-minded ENT surgeons, the Burning Mouth community is actively compiling a directory of enlightened dentists and physicians. By sharing our diagnostic records, treatment responses, and clinician recommendations, we can point sufferers directly toward professionals who understand peripheral trigeminal neurobiology and micro-restorative sealing.</p>

